No traffic. No parking. A lil route planning and that’s it.

Won’t last long, but I’m finishing the process & waiting on the permit, so the car’s gotta wait.

It’s wild how much time this actually gives me back. Just me, a window, and 40 minutes I’d normally lose, now going straight into client work and clearing admin I’d been putting off.

Relaxing and unwinding on transit that’s clean, safe, and somehow almost always on time. A bit crazy how efficient the system is.

But then again… it’s Germany. So maybe not that crazy.

